Mm-hmm.

135
00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:58.750
And then, in season four, it was the writer's strike.

136
00:07:58.970 --> 00:07:59.490
I know.

137
00:07:59.770 --> 00:08:01.510
We missed a Christmas party.

138
00:08:01.810 --> 00:08:05.470
