144
00:08:15.630 --> 00:08:17.930
It was like a whole episode of Conference Room.

145
00:08:18.310 --> 00:08:19.790
So, lots of bits.

146
00:08:20.030 --> 00:08:20.490
Lots of bits.

147
00:08:20.490 --> 00:08:21.030
Lots of laughing.

148
00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.050
We would just have the best time.

