158
00:08:51.830 --> 00:08:52.130
Mm-hmm.

159
00:08:52.130 --> 00:08:55.530
And that maybe the success had gone to her head a little bit.

160
00:08:55.730 --> 00:08:56.810
And she's going to go big.

161
00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:57.650
Big theme.

162
00:08:57.870 --> 00:08:58.310
Yes.

163
00:08:58.730 --> 00:09:01.430
They loved that this would piss Angela off.

164
00:09:01.650 --> 00:09:02.070
Mm-hmm.

165
00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.770
So, this was like one card.

166
00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:05.430
Right.

167
