176
00:09:17.910 --> 00:09:19.750
I tell you, she has levels of anger.

177
00:09:20.030 --> 00:09:22.010
Sometimes she's like suspicious bitch.

178
00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.490
Sometimes she's happy bitch.

179
00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:24.050
Yeah.

180
00:09:24.050 --> 00:09:24.970
Sometimes she's sad bitch.

181
00:09:25.570 --> 00:09:25.830
Hmm.

182
00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:28.090
And then Christmas bitch is a whole different bitch.

183
00:09:28.310 --> 00:09:28.950
Oh, boy.

184
00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:31.210
Buckle in for Christmas bitch.

185
00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:37.430
Okay, so the other card that they had on the wall for a really long time said Meredith

