00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.170
Intervention.

187
00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:39.430
Oh, okay.

188
00:09:39.830 --> 00:09:42.850
So, they decided to marry these two ideas.

189
00:09:43.450 --> 00:09:47.450
Remember when they did like Michael has to fire someone on Halloween while we're all dressed

