00:25:39.420 --> 00:25:46.740
So, later in the episode, when Michael is dragging Meredith into a rehab center, it's

548
00:25:46.740 --> 00:25:47.580
Christmas Eve.

549
00:25:47.740 --> 00:25:49.580
According to the dry erase board.

