00:25:49.740 --> 00:25:54.500
I don't know if that's what the writers intended, but that really got me tickled.

551
00:25:54.640 --> 00:25:56.580
And I have a bone to pick with Phyllis.

552
00:25:56.940 --> 00:25:57.460
Oh.

553
00:25:57.460 --> 00:26:00.880
