00:26:37.280 --> 00:26:40.840
And then these little details, I guess, are just little jabs.

568
00:26:41.000 --> 00:26:41.720
Little digs.

569
00:26:41.840 --> 00:26:44.200
I mean, she makes Angela get rid of the Christmas tree.

570
00:26:44.200 --> 00:26:45.440
Oh, lady.

571
00:26:45.820 --> 00:26:46.080
All right.

572
00:26:46.180 --> 00:26:50.480
I have to share about this because in the episode, it's like three seconds, right?

573
00:26:50.720 --> 00:26:50.900
Yeah.

574
00:26:51.260 --> 00:26:52.900
This was a huge scene.

575
00:26:53.440 --> 00:26:56.400
This was like multiple location scenes, you guys.

576
00:26:56.640 --> 00:26:58.280
It took like a half of a day.

577
00:26:58.760 --> 00:26:59.200
What?

578
00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.000
Yes.

